WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.291
Unit twenty-one. Dental Health!

2
00:00:04.241 --> 00:00:08.295
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.345 --> 00:00:11.729
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.779 --> 00:00:15.479
Today we learn about Dental Health. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.341 --> 00:00:19.707
Teeth. Say it with me. Teeth!

6
00:00:23.229 --> 00:00:26.663
Plaque. Say it with me. Plaque!

7
00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:33.829
Cavity. Say it with me. Cavity!

8
00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:40.946
Fluoride. Say it with me. Fluoride!

9
00:00:44.451 --> 00:00:48.001
Floss. Say it with me. Floss!

10
00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:55.034
Dentist. Say it with me. Dentist!

11
00:00:58.548 --> 00:01:01.898
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

12
00:01:05.382 --> 00:01:08.649
Gums. Say it with me. Gums!

13
00:01:12.221 --> 00:01:22.076
Plaque is a sticky layer of germs on my teeth. If I do not brush it off, it can cause a cavity and sore gums. I brush with fluoride toothpaste, floss, and visit the dentist.

14
00:01:22.126 --> 00:01:23.311
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:29.932
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.982 --> 00:01:31.132
Cavity!

17
00:01:32.129 --> 00:01:37.185
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.235 --> 00:01:38.385
Sugar!

19
00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:45.061
Did you know? Brushing for two minutes, twice a day, is a good habit for healthy teeth!

20
00:01:45.111 --> 00:01:47.000
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.681 --> 00:01:54.805
Think and answer. What causes a cavity?

22
00:01:54.855 --> 00:01:56.010
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.264 --> 00:02:02.093
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.143 --> 00:02:04.771
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

